    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d339-a8">

                <pb facs="0548" n="452" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg452"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Indorsements.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters Department of Texas</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >San Antonio</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 23,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Respectfully forwarded to the Adjutant-General United States Army, through
                    division headquarters.</p>
                <p>These two letters contain all the information I have been able to get from Del
                    Norte concerning the Indians said to have been engaged in the Howard’s Well
                    massacre.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. C. AUGUR,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Brigadier-General,
                            Commanding.</hi></signed>
                </closer>




